# The paths whose pull requests wait for pgoell's review: CI and the review
# itself, deploy and containers, agent settings and hooks, the database, auth,
# tokens, billing, and the dependency files. Branch protection requires a code
# owner's approval, which no workflow can forge, and GitHub reads this file from
# the base branch, so a pull request cannot take itself off the list. A push
# dismisses the approval. The security review reads this list too: it reruns on
# a later push that touches one of these paths (.github/review/round.sh).
